	(text "Stage S1: the frozen S0 core (42747f4) at the tube's values in air, 120 Hz\n(rebuild/s1_tube/).\nGain per cycle z = 1.18702 bare, 1.17590 with the record's C_k and strays\n  (rebuild/s1_tube/s1_pulsed_core_results.json). Real sticks: 1.1806 bare\n  (rebuild/s1_tube/s1_bare_results.json).\nThe core is pulsed (DECIDED 2026-10-15): S0's 180 deg makes V1 - V4 a pure\nalternating wave, no extra part.\nGround: it floats in the core (its midplane is the neutral), or a virtual one from\nN1 and N4 if necessary\n  (DECIDED 2026-10-15). REF is the varicaps' stator side, not the ground.\nCk, Cr1 and Cr4 are field quantities, not bought parts: drawn so the netlist carries\nthem (not in the BOM).\nNot drawn, by decision or still open:\n  - the voltage limit: S1 shows one is needed under the gap's 19.70 kV; its kind is\n    OPEN (s1-bare-findings.md);\n  - an HV seed source: only if the machine does not start (DECIDED 2026-10-15);\n  - the buffer / multiplier options: studied, not chosen (s1-multiplier-tap-\n    findings.md, s1-stress-options-findings.md).\nNetlist checked node for node against S0's TOPOLOGY plus these additions, and\nagainst the solver circuit\n  of rebuild/s1_tube/s1_pulsed_core.py (rebuild/kicad/kicad_check_results.json)."
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 294.64 115.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1c91b923-92e4-5a40-90d5-60394b465c9e")
	)
